+# Exact checkpointed build projection successor
+
+The existing scientific producer/1 and public projection/1 behavior remains. An explicit native checkpoint bridge admits only airk.cuda-static-build-proof/2 paired with airk.private.cuda-checkpointed-build/1 and PASS_CHECKPOINTED_PRODUCER_ONLY_UNQUALIFIED. It is metadata-only and grants no execution, model, numerical, resource, or release qualification. Root-approved target plan6bee and failed R12 digest3a4 remain fixed. Sections are Flash48, LLM43, final all+re2, in order, same source/tool/config, parallel2. First runner b382/input68a5 and reviewed successor797c/inputc118 are the only allowed sources; unexecuted successor R2 is refused. Each section must prove its original fixed10800s/campaign-clipped cutoff, actual whole-tree exit0 and naturally empty original Job, no timeout/force, immutable input/source/warm/Ninja custody. R12 failure remains failed and is never a continuous cold3h pass.
+
+Source.read retains protected no-follow held-object custody under the original operation deadline. Every FilePin is reopened with bounded bytes/hash/length; immutable first Ninja copies must equal original declared bytes/hash WITHOUT reopening legitimately mutated old Ninja paths. Explicit metadata custody copies may redirect only Source.read <=16MiB; Source.authenticate for binaries/code never redirects, unused mappings refuse at final recheck. Input.custody_copies defaults omitted-empty, preserving old serialized input.
+
+The one strict validator is reused by native scientific observe_assembly and the projector. Canonical proof/2 remains integer-only; raw timing receipts are separately hashed. The maintained verifier owns full Ninja/COFF/static96 target recomputation; native validates exact proof/raw/section/source/custody/provider bindings, original deadlines and settlement, source+toolchain closure, then rechecks held sources. Public provenance adds omitted-empty checkpoint_history carrying plan/section/failed-history digests and explicit checkpointed-warm/not-cold/not-qualified labels; no private paths or raw receipts ship. Public fields do not become authority. Legacy output bytes with no history remain unchanged.
+
+This private successor is separate from already-applied R4. No actual successful composite/hash is invented; the producer final source/input and all outputs must be genuine caller-pinned bytes. All original failed receipts are immutable.
+
+Exact composer096a/inpute610 adds output_policy (opaque private custody observation) and metadata_composition_seconds (finite0..300s) explicitly to the raw composite. These remain private and are never public authority. Maintained proof toolchain_pins MUST project exact path/bytes/sha256 only, excluding raw version/probe/timing data. The public history is descriptive, omitted for historical output, and carries no timing/cold-build claim. Historical CMake/Ninja protected-file custody remains an explicit actual-run prerequisite until Root approves a distinct bounded evidence-only reading contract; aliases/executable authentication are not weakened here.
+
